# A Chocobo's Tale (jeuno 72): Upper Jeuno's Nevela (no script; default 69), Bastok Mines' Wobke (no script; default 244),
# Pashhow Marshlands' Outpost_Gate (default GATE_IS_LOCKED), Batallia Downs' qm_chocobotale (default YOU_FIND_NOTHING) and
# its five Badshahs (BADSHAH_OFFSET .. + 4). A level 75 Warrior, CoP The Road Forks current, four Bottles of Warding Oil
# and a Chocobo Feather. Available: Nevela's 10015: begun. Accepted: Nevela at Prog 0: 10016. Wobke: 245 (Prog 1), then
# 246. The gate: three oils at Prog 1: nil; trigger: 21 (0, Warding Oil): Prog 2; trigger at Prog 2: nil (GATE_IS_LOCKED);
# two oils: nil; four: nil; three and the feather: nil; three: 22: Prog 3 (the oil kept). Wobke at Prog 3: 247 (0, Warding
# Oil): Prog 4; then 248. The qm at Prog 4: the five spawned claimed (YOU_ARE_BEING_ATTACKED); again with them up: nil
# (YOU_FIND_NOTHING); four killed (the first death sets nmDefeated), the fifth up: nil; the fifth killed: the Silver
# Comet's Collar (after the five despawned), Prog 5; again: nil. Nevela at Prog 5: 10017: completed (5200 gil, Chocobo Love Guru), fame +7 x3, the
# collar taken. Completed: 10018; three oils to the gate: nothing.
lists UpperJeuno/Nevela/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/10015 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/10017 BastokMines/Wobke/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventFinish/245 BastokMines/onEventFinish/247 PashhowMarshlands/Outpost_Gate/onTrade PashhowMarshlands/Outpost_Gate/onTrigger PashhowMarshlands/onEventFinish/21 PashhowMarshlands/onEventFinish/22 BatalliaDowns/qm_chocobotale/onTrigger BatalliaDowns/Badshah/onMobDeath
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-58.6,0,81.1 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop TheRoadForks current
item BottleOfWardingOil x4
item ChocoboFeather
login
trigger Nevela                          # available: 10015
finish                                  # begun
trigger Nevela                          # Prog 0: 10016
finish
warp 30.5,0.9,-111.6 BastokMines        # by Wobke
trigger Wobke                           # Prog 0: 245
finish                                  # Prog 1
trigger Wobke                           # Prog 1: 246
finish
warp 472,23.4,413.1 PashhowMarshlands   # by the Outpost Gate
trade Outpost_Gate BottleOfWardingOil x3 # Prog 1: nil; nothing
trigger Outpost_Gate                    # Prog 1: 21 (0, Warding Oil)
finish                                  # Prog 2
trigger Outpost_Gate                    # Prog 2: nil; GATE_IS_LOCKED
trade Outpost_Gate BottleOfWardingOil x2 # two: nil
trade Outpost_Gate BottleOfWardingOil x4 # four: nil
trade Outpost_Gate BottleOfWardingOil x3 ChocoboFeather x1 # three and an extra item: nil
trade Outpost_Gate BottleOfWardingOil x3 # three, Prog 2: 22
finish                                  # Prog 3; the oil kept
warp 30.5,0.9,-111.6 BastokMines        # by Wobke
trigger Wobke                           # Prog 3: 247 (0, Warding Oil)
finish                                  # Prog 4
trigger Wobke                           # Prog 4: 248
finish
warp -37.9,-11.1,307.3 BatalliaDowns    # by the qm
trigger qm_chocobotale                  # Prog 4, none up, no nmDefeated: the five spawned; YOU_ARE_BEING_ATTACKED
trigger qm_chocobotale                  # Badshahs up: nil; YOU_FIND_NOTHING
kill BADSHAH_OFFSET                     # onMobDeath, Prog 4: nmDefeated 1
kill BADSHAH_OFFSET+1
kill BADSHAH_OFFSET+2
kill BADSHAH_OFFSET+3
trigger qm_chocobotale                  # +4 still up: nil; YOU_FIND_NOTHING
kill BADSHAH_OFFSET+4
tick 15000                              # the Badshahs despawning (the death and the despawn each take a zone tick)
tick 30000                              # despawned
trigger qm_chocobotale                  # none up, nmDefeated: the Silver Comet's Collar; Prog 5
trigger qm_chocobotale                  # Prog 5: nil; YOU_FIND_NOTHING
warp -58.6,0,81.1 UpperJeuno            # by Nevela
trigger Nevela                          # Prog 5: 10017
finish                                  # completed: 5200 gil, Chocobo Love Guru; fame +7 x3; the collar taken
trigger Nevela                          # completed: 10018 (replacing her default)
finish
warp 472,23.4,413.1 PashhowMarshlands   # by the Outpost Gate
trade Outpost_Gate BottleOfWardingOil x3 # completed: no onTrade: nothing (the oils kept)
